{"strongs": "H0709", "word": "אַרְגֹּב", "translit": "ar.gov", "root": "רגב", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name", "gloss": "heap", "definition": "אַרְגֹּב proper name 1. location ( heap , or region of clods; 'glede' GASm G551 ); — always ׳ חֶבֶל א Deut 3:4 ; Deut 3:14 ; 1Kgs 4:13 , ׳ הָא ׳ ח Deut 3:13 = measured region of Argob ; some well-defined district of Bashan (apparently identification with חַוֺת יָאִיר Deut 3:14 [where ׳ י ׳ ח in Bashan, so Josh 13:30 ], but this a harmonistic correction; ׳ י ׳ ח in fact in Gilead [ Num 32:41 ; Judg 10:4 , and distinguished from אַרְגֹּב 1Kgs 4:13 compare Deut 3:13 ); exact location dubious, GASm l.c. and especially Dr Deut 3:4 ; Buhl Geogr.18 thinks of ‚uwet , south of Upper Yarmuk, a border district between Bashan and Gilead. — Αρσοβ ; 1Kgs 4:13 Ερεβαταμ , ᵐ5 L Πασαβαν , A Ερσαβ . 2. masculine 2Kgs 15:25 , Αρσοβ dubious; see Klo Kit Benz Bur .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7737')\">BDB7737</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H709')\">H709</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7736')\">BDB7736</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7738')\">BDB7738</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַרְגֹּב</bdbheb> <b>proper name</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. location</b> (<highlight>heap</highlight>, or <highlight>region of clods; 'glede'</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>G551</sup></lookup>); — always <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חֶבֶל א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,4)\">Deut 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,14)\">Deut 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,13)\">1Kgs 4:13</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הָא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,13)\">Deut 3:13</ref> = <highlight>measured region of Argob</highlight>; some well-defined district of Bashan (apparently identification with <bdbheb>חַוֺת יָאִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,14)\">Deut 3:14</ref> [where <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> in Bashan, so <ref ref=\"Josh 13:30\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,30)\">Josh 13:30</ref>], but this a harmonistic correction; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> in fact in Gilead [<ref ref=\"Num 32:41\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,41)\">Num 32:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 10:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,4)\">Judg 10:4</ref>, and distinguished from <bdbheb>אַרְגֹּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,13)\">1Kgs 4:13</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Deut 3:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,13)\">Deut 3:13</ref>); exact location dubious, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>l.c. and</sup></lookup> especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Deut 3:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,4)\">Deut 3:4</ref></sup></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr.18</sup></lookup> thinks of <transliteration><highlight>‚uwet</highlight></transliteration>, south of Upper Yarmuk, a border district between Bashan and Gilead. — <grk>Αρσοβ</grk>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,13)\">1Kgs 4:13</ref> <grk>Ερεβαταμ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Πασαβαν</grk>, <lookup o